b584f113-e7b2-4bc9-9a50-adc2976d345b/6680-0
00:48:34.202 --> 00:48:35.002
<v Ashiq Ali>रेडमी साइंडिंग।</v>

b584f113-e7b2-4bc9-9a50-adc2976d345b/6685-0
00:48:38.812 --> 00:48:40.172
<v Ashiq Ali>क्या तो एक मैंने?</v>

b584f113-e7b2-4bc9-9a50-adc2976d345b/6701-0
00:48:43.542 --> 00:48:47.006
<v Ashiq Ali>ठीक है यूज़र करेक्ट,
