b584f113-e7b2-4bc9-9a50-adc2976d345b/7241-1
00:52:35.496 --> 00:52:36.482
<v Ashiq Ali>है पूरा। करेक्ट?</v>

b584f113-e7b2-4bc9-9a50-adc2976d345b/7243-0
